{
  "_doc": [
    "Brand -> active ingredients, ingredient -> rule groups, dose-form words and drug-lab effect windows (medicine_profile.py).",
    "Every class rule (NSAID, corticosteroid, azole, PPI, calcium / vitamin D) runs on the ingredients a product expands to, never on its brand name.",
    "Resolution order for a prescription line: this brand table -> each part of a '+' combination -> ingredient names written in the line -> the cached term resolution (clinical_terms) -> unmapped.",
    "Unmapped products, and products only the model resolved, are written to the unmapped-brands report (config UNMAPPED_BRANDS_REPORT) so they can be added here.",
    "Brand keys are lower case, without dose-form words (tab, cream, gel ...) or strengths. Add a brand only when its composition has been checked; set verified_by / verified_on when a pharmacist has checked an entry."
  ],
