  "_groups_doc": "Rule group -> the registry medicine class it stands for. For corticosteroids and azoles the class depends on the route: topical -> topical_class, a systemic route -> systemic_class, an unclear route -> both (rules that need a systemic route then report it for checking, not as fact).",
  "groups": {
    "nsaid": {
      "class": "NSAID (pain / anti-inflammatory)",
      "terms": [
